        "question": "What academic mathematics book does Lisbeth Salander carry around and memorize?",
        "answer": "Lisbeth Salander carries around and has memorized the book **Dimensions in Mathematics** [E1]. She had known the text by heart due to her photographic memory, carrying the physical book as a \"talisman\" linked to Fermat [E1].",
        "citations": [
          "[E1]"
